{"seq":3,"slug":"async-await","title":"async/await 与异步运行时","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/concurrency/async-await","wordCount":736,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"async-await-与异步运行时\">async/await 与异步运行时</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rust 的异步是<strong>协作式</strong>且<strong>零成本</strong>的：<code>async fn</code> 在编译期被转换为实现了 <code>Future</code> 的状态机，<code>.await</code> 只是状态机的挂起点标记。理解本篇的关键，是认识到 Future 是<strong>惰性</strong>的——创建它不会执行任何事，只有被 <code>await</code> 或交给运行时调度才会推进，这与 Promise 的即时启动截然不同。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>运行时是外部依赖</strong>：标准库只定义 <code>Future</code> trait，<code>Tokio</code> 等运行时负责调度、I/O 与定时器，因此异步代码必须运行在运行时之上。</li>\n<li><strong><code>.await</code> 是协作点</strong>：只有显式 <code>.await</code>（或 <code>join!</code>/<code>select!</code>）时任务才会让出，长时间不 await 的代码会阻塞整个执行器。</li>\n<li><strong>跨 <code>.await</code> 的约束被类型化</strong>：<code>tokio::spawn</code> 要求 Future 为 <code>Send</code>，这直接决定了不能跨越 await 持有非 <code>Send</code> 的锁或引用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"异步编程模型\">异步编程模型</h2><p>Rust 的异步编程基于 <code>Future</code> trait，通过 <code>async/await</code> 语法实现零成本的协作式多任务。异步代码在逻辑上是并发的，但可以在单个线程上运行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;async fn&quot;] --&gt;|编译为| B[&quot;impl Future&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|注册到| C[&quot;异步运行时 Runtime&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|调度| D[&quot;Executor 执行器&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|就绪时| E[&quot;poll() → Poll::Ready&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|未就绪| F[&quot;poll() → Poll::Pending&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|Waker 唤醒| D\">graph TD\n    A[\"async fn\"] --&gt;|编译为| B[\"impl Future\"]\n    B --&gt;|注册到| C[\"异步运行时 Runtime\"]\n    C --&gt;|调度| D[\"Executor 执行器\"]\n    D --&gt;|就绪时| E[\"poll() → Poll::Ready\"]\n    D --&gt;|未就绪| F[\"poll() → Poll::Pending\"]\n    F --&gt;|Waker 唤醒| D</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"future-trait\">Future Trait</h2><p><code>Future</code> 是 Rust 异步编程的核心抽象。与 JavaScript 的 Promise 不同，Rust 的 Future 是惰性的——创建后不会立即执行，必须被 <code>.await</code> 或提交给运行时。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::future::Future;&#10;use std::pin::Pin;&#10;use std::task::{Context, Poll};&#10;&#10;struct Delay {&#10;    duration: std::time::Duration,&#10;    started: Option&lt;std::time::Instant&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Future for Delay {&#10;    type Output = ();&#10;&#10;    fn poll(mut self: Pin&lt;&amp;mut Self&gt;, cx: &amp;mut Context&lt;&#39;_&gt;) -&gt; Poll&lt;()&gt; {&#10;        let started = self.started.get_or_insert_with(std::time::Instant::now);&#10;        if started.elapsed() &gt;= self.duration {&#10;            Poll::Ready(())&#10;        } else {&#10;            let waker = cx.waker().clone();&#10;            let remaining = self.duration - started.elapsed();&#10;            std::thread::spawn(move || {&#10;                std::thread::sleep(remaining);&#10;                waker.wake();&#10;            });&#10;            Poll::Pending&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::future::Future;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::pin::Pin;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::task::{Context, Poll};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Delay {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    duration: std::time::Duration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    started: Option&#x3C;std::time::Instant>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Future for Delay {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Output = ();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn poll(mut self: Pin&#x3C;&#x26;mut Self>, cx: &#x26;mut Context&#x3C;'_>) -> Poll&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let started = self.started.get_or_insert_with(std::time::Instant::now);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if started.elapsed() >= self.duration {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Poll::Ready(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let waker = cx.waker().clone();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let remaining = self.duration - started.elapsed();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            std::thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                std::thread::sleep(remaining);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                waker.wake();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Poll::Pending</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"async-await-语法\">async/await 语法</h2><p><code>async fn</code> 返回一个实现 <code>Future</code> 的匿名类型。<code>.await</code> 挂起当前任务，等待 Future 完成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"async fn fetch_data(url: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;String, reqwest::Error&gt; {&#10;    let response = reqwest::get(url).await?;&#10;    let body = response.text().await?;&#10;    Ok(body)&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn process() {&#10;    match fetch_data(&quot;https://httpbin.org/get&quot;).await {&#10;        Ok(data) =&gt; println!(&quot;数据长度: {}&quot;, data.len()),&#10;        Err(e) =&gt; eprintln!(&quot;请求失败: {}&quot;, e),&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async fn fetch_data(url: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;String, reqwest::Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let response = reqwest::get(url).await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let body = response.text().await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn process() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match fetch_data(\"https://httpbin.org/get\").await {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(data) => println!(\"数据长度: {}\", data.len()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(e) => eprintln!(\"请求失败: {}\", e),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"tokio-运行时\">Tokio 运行时</h2><p>Tokio 是 Rust 最流行的异步运行时，提供多线程调度器、异步 I/O、定时器等基础设施。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[tokio::main]&#10;async fn main() {&#10;    let handle1 = tokio::spawn(async {&#10;        tokio::time::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_secs(1)).await;&#10;        println!(&quot;任务 1 完成&quot;);&#10;        42&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    let handle2 = tokio::spawn(async {&#10;        tokio::time::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(500)).await;&#10;        println!(&quot;任务 2 完成&quot;);&#10;        &quot;hello&quot;&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    let (r1, r2) = tokio::join!(handle1, handle2);&#10;    println!(&quot;结果: {:?}, {:?}&quot;, r1.unwrap(), r2.unwrap());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[tokio::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let handle1 = tokio::spawn(async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokio::time::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_secs(1)).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"任务 1 完成\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let handle2 = tokio::spawn(async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokio::time::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(500)).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"任务 2 完成\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let (r1, r2) = tokio::join!(handle1, handle2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"结果: {:?}, {:?}\", r1.unwrap(), r2.unwrap());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"tokio-运行时配置\">Tokio 运行时配置</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>宏</th>\n<th>线程数</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多线程</td>\n<td><code>#[tokio::main]</code></td>\n<td>默认 CPU 核心数</td>\n<td>生产环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当前线程</td>\n<td><code>#[tokio::main(flavor = &quot;current_thread&quot;)]</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>测试、嵌入式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动构建</td>\n<td><code>Runtime::new()</code></td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>精细控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"并发执行模式\">并发执行模式</h2><h3 id=\"join-并行等待多个-future\">join!：并行等待多个 Future</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tokio::time::{sleep, Duration};&#10;&#10;async fn task_a() -&gt; i32 {&#10;    sleep(Duration::from_secs(2)).await;&#10;    1&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn task_b() -&gt; i32 {&#10;    sleep(Duration::from_secs(1)).await;&#10;    2&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[tokio::main]&#10;async fn main() {&#10;    let (a, b) = tokio::join!(task_a(), task_b());&#10;    println!(&quot;结果: {} + {} = {}&quot;, a, b, a + b);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::time::{sleep, Duration};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn task_a() -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sleep(Duration::from_secs(2)).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn task_b() -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sleep(Duration::from_secs(1)).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[tokio::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let (a, b) = tokio::join!(task_a(), task_b());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"结果: {} + {} = {}\", a, b, a + b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"select-竞争执行\">select!：竞争执行</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tokio::time::{sleep, Duration};&#10;&#10;#[tokio::main]&#10;async fn main() {&#10;    tokio::select! {&#10;        _ = sleep(Duration::from_secs(1)) =&gt; {&#10;            println!(&quot;定时器到期&quot;);&#10;        }&#10;        _ = async {&#10;            sleep(Duration::from_millis(500)).await;&#10;        } =&gt; {&#10;            println!(&quot;快速任务完成&quot;);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::time::{sleep, Duration};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[tokio::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tokio::select! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _ = sleep(Duration::from_secs(1)) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"定时器到期\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _ = async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            sleep(Duration::from_millis(500)).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"快速任务完成\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>join!</code></td>\n<td>等待所有 Future 完成</td>\n<td>并行获取多个资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>select!</code></td>\n<td>等待第一个完成的 Future</td>\n<td>超时控制、取消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>spawn</code></td>\n<td>在后台执行</td>\n<td>不需要等待结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"异步-stream\">异步 Stream</h2><p>Stream 是异步版本的 Iterator，逐步产出值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tokio_stream::{self as stream, StreamExt};&#10;&#10;#[tokio::main]&#10;async fn main() {&#10;    let mut stream = stream::iter(vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5])&#10;        .filter(|x| x % 2 == 0)&#10;        .map(|x| x * 10);&#10;&#10;    while let Some(value) = stream.next().await {&#10;        println!(&quot;值: {}&quot;, value);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio_stream::{self as stream, StreamExt};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[tokio::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut stream = stream::iter(vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .filter(|x| x % 2 == 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(|x| x * 10);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while let Some(value) = stream.next().await {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"值: {}\", value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"async-trait\">async Trait</h2><p><code>async fn</code> 在 trait 中的支持从 Rust 1.75 开始稳定（需要 <code>impl Trait in return position</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"trait HttpClient {&#10;    async fn get(&amp;self, url: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;String, Box&lt;dyn std::error::Error&gt;&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct MyClient;&#10;&#10;impl HttpClient for MyClient {&#10;    async fn get(&amp;self, url: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;String, Box&lt;dyn std::error::Error&gt;&gt; {&#10;        let resp = reqwest::get(url).await?;&#10;        Ok(resp.text().await?)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>trait HttpClient {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async fn get(&#x26;self, url: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;String, Box&#x3C;dyn std::error::Error>>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct MyClient;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl HttpClient for MyClient {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async fn get(&#x26;self, url: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;String, Box&#x3C;dyn std::error::Error>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let resp = reqwest::get(url).await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(resp.text().await?)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱与最佳实践\">常见陷阱与最佳实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>在 async 中使用 <code>std::sync::Mutex</code></td>\n<td>持有锁期间 <code>.await</code> 会阻塞运行时</td>\n<td>使用 <code>tokio::sync::Mutex</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阻塞调用进入异步运行时</td>\n<td>CPU 密集或阻塞 I/O 占据线程</td>\n<td>使用 <code>spawn_blocking()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Future 未 <code>.await</code></td>\n<td>Future 是惰性的，不 await 不执行</td>\n<td>确保所有 Future 被 await 或 spawn</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Send 约束</td>\n<td><code>tokio::spawn</code> 要求 Future 为 <code>Send</code></td>\n<td>避免在 <code>.await</code> 点持有非 Send 类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>async fn</code> 编译为惰性的 <code>Future</code> 状态机，必须被 <code>.await</code> 或交给运行时才会执行。</li>\n<li>标准库只提供 <code>Future</code> trait，实际调度依赖 <code>Tokio</code> 等运行时。</li>\n<li><code>join!</code> 并行等待多个 Future，<code>select!</code> 等待第一个完成（常用于超时与取消），<code>spawn</code> 用于后台任务。</li>\n<li><code>.await</code> 是协作点：阻塞调用与 <code>std::sync::Mutex</code> 跨越 await 都会拖垮执行器，应改用 <code>spawn_blocking</code> 与 <code>tokio::sync::Mutex</code>。</li>\n<li>Rust 1.75 起 <code>async fn</code> 可直接用于 trait，简化了异步接口的定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"async/await 与异步运行时","id":"async-await-与异步运行时"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"异步编程模型","id":"异步编程模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Future Trait","id":"future-trait"},{"level":2,"text":"async/await 语法","id":"async-await-语法"},{"level":2,"text":"Tokio 运行时","id":"tokio-运行时"},{"level":3,"text":"Tokio 运行时配置","id":"tokio-运行时配置"},{"level":2,"text":"并发执行模式","id":"并发执行模式"},{"level":3,"text":"join!：并行等待多个 Future","id":"join-并行等待多个-future"},{"level":3,"text":"select!：竞争执行","id":"select-竞争执行"},{"level":2,"text":"异步 Stream","id":"异步-stream"},{"level":2,"text":"async Trait","id":"async-trait"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱与最佳实践","id":"常见陷阱与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"共享状态与 Mutex","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/concurrency/shared-state"},"next":{"title":"无锁编程与原子操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/concurrency/lock-free"}}